WEBVTT

00:09.172 --> 00:10.482
- ARE YA READY, KIDS?
- 孩子们，准备好了吗？

00:10.517 --> 00:12.172
kids: AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN.
孩子们：是的，是的，队长。

00:12.206 --> 00:13.655
- I CAN'T HEAR YOU.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:13.689 --> 00:15.793
kids: AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
孩子们：是啊，是啊，队长！

00:15.827 --> 00:18.551
- OHHHH....
- 哦哦....

00:18.586 --> 00:20.965
♪ WHO LIVES IN A PINEAPPLE
UNDER THE SEA ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
海底♪

00:21.000 --> 00:23.241
kids: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
孩子们：海绵宝宝！

00:23.275 --> 00:24.517
- ♪ ABSORBENT AND YELLOW
AND POROUS IS HE ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:24.551 --> 00:26.965
kids: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
孩子们：海绵宝宝！

00:27.000 --> 00:28.827
- ♪ IF NAUTICAL NONSENSE
BE SOMETHING YOU WISH ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你所希望的 ♪

00:28.862 --> 00:30.793
kids: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
孩子们：海绵宝宝！

00:30.827 --> 00:33.172
- ♪ THEN DROP ON THE DECK
AND FLOP LIKE A FISH ♪
- ♪ 然后掉到甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:33.206 --> 00:35.206
kids: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
- READY?
孩子们：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:35.241 --> 00:37.000
[kids and pirate]
- ♪ SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS ♪
[孩子和海盗]
- ♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:37.034 --> 00:39.172
♪ SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:39.206 --> 00:41.137
♪ SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:41.172 --> 00:44.724
[pirate]
- ♪ SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS ♪
[海盗]
- ♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:44.758 --> 00:46.655
HA, HA!
HA, HA, HA!
哈，哈！
哈，哈，哈！

00:46.689 --> 00:49.034
[nose tooting like whistle]
[鼻子发出类似口哨的声音]

00:54.724 --> 00:57.689
[cheery music]
[欢快的音乐]

00:57.724 --> 01:05.724
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪

01:05.758 --> 01:07.000
- GOOD MORNING, PATRICK.
- 早上好，帕特里克。

01:07.034 --> 01:08.413
- HEY, SPONGEBOB.
- 嘿，海绵宝宝。

01:08.448 --> 01:10.034
- YOU READY FOR SOME FUN,
OLD PAL?
- 你准备好享受一些乐趣了，
老朋友？

01:10.068 --> 01:11.517
- I SURE AM, OLD BUDDY.
- 我当然可以，老伙计。

01:11.551 --> 01:14.413
- HEY, HERE COMES FUN NOW.
- 嘿，现在很有趣。

01:16.896 --> 01:20.413
[screaming]
[尖叫]

01:20.448 --> 01:23.931
[screaming continues]
[尖叫声继续]

01:23.965 --> 01:26.896
[squeaking like dolphins]
[像海豚一样吱吱叫]

01:26.931 --> 01:29.172
[laughing]
[笑]

01:29.206 --> 01:30.827
OH, WOW.
哦，哇。

01:30.862 --> 01:32.689
IT DOESN'T GET
ANY BETTER THAN THAT.
没有得到
比那更好。

01:32.724 --> 01:35.551
- YEAH, I LOVE BOAT SCREAMING.
- 是的，我喜欢船的尖叫声。

01:35.586 --> 01:36.551
OH, HEY, HEY, HEY!
哦，嘿，嘿，嘿！

01:36.586 --> 01:39.068
HERE COMES ANOTHER ONE!
另一位来了！

01:39.103 --> 01:41.068
- [screaming]
- [尖叫]

01:41.103 --> 01:42.068
[snap!]
[折断！]

01:42.103 --> 01:43.482
- HERE COMES ANOTHER ONE.
- 又来了一个。

01:43.517 --> 01:46.068
- [screaming]
- [尖叫]

01:46.103 --> 01:47.482
- [screaming]
- [尖叫]

01:47.517 --> 01:48.655
[engine buzzing]
[发动机嗡嗡声]

01:48.689 --> 01:50.000
- [sighing]
- [叹气]

01:50.034 --> 01:51.172
[engine puttering]
[发动机的轰鸣声]

01:51.206 --> 01:52.586
[sighing lower]
[低声叹气]

01:52.620 --> 01:53.620
[wheel squeaking]
[车轮吱吱作响]

01:53.655 --> 01:55.310
- [barely breathing]
- [几乎没有呼吸]

01:55.344 --> 01:56.620
- MORONS.
- 白痴。

01:56.655 --> 01:57.827
[engine rumbling]
[发动机轰鸣]

01:57.862 --> 01:59.448
- EE, EE, EE, EE!
- EE，EE，EE，EE！
- EE，EE，EE，EE！
- EE，EE，EE，EE！
- EE，EE，EE，EE！
- EE，EE，EE，EE！
- EE，EE，EE，EE！
- EE，EE，EE，EE！

01:59.482 --> 02:01.931
- [screaming]
- [尖叫]

02:01.965 --> 02:03.103
[screaming insanely]
[疯狂尖叫]

02:03.137 --> 02:05.275
[honk! ding! clunk!]
[喇叭！叮！叮当！]

02:05.310 --> 02:06.724
[engine whirring]
[引擎的呼呼声]

02:06.758 --> 02:09.034
[screaming]
[尖叫]

02:09.068 --> 02:13.103
- WOULD YOU TWO MIND STOPPING
WITH YOUR BABY GAMES?
- 你们两个介意停下来吗
和你的宝宝一起玩游戏吗？

02:13.137 --> 02:16.000
DIDN'T ANYBODY TELL YOU
IT'S THE BREAK OF DAWN?
没有人告诉你吗
现在是黎明吗？

02:16.034 --> 02:17.551
- OH, GOOD MORNING, SQUIDWARD.
- 哦，早上好，章鱼哥。

02:17.586 --> 02:19.275
YEAH, PATRICK HERE TOLD ME.
是的，帕特里克在这里告诉我的。

02:19.310 --> 02:21.758
- WHEN ARE YOU TWO
GONNA GROW UP?
- 你们两个什么时候
会长大吗？

02:21.793 --> 02:23.310
- HOW DO YOU PLAY THAT?
- 你怎么玩这个？

02:23.344 --> 02:25.931
- OH! MAYBE SQUIDWARD
CAN COME DOWN
- 哦！也许是章鱼哥
可以下来

02:25.965 --> 02:27.758
AND TEACH US
HOW TO PLAY IT!
并教导我们
怎么玩！

02:27.793 --> 02:31.586
THAT'LL BE REALFUN,
WON'T IT, PATRICK?
那真的很有趣，
不是吗，帕特里克？

02:31.620 --> 02:33.034
[honk]
[鸣喇叭]

02:33.068 --> 02:35.034
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

02:35.068 --> 02:36.344
HUH.
呵呵。

02:36.379 --> 02:38.586
[barking]
[叫声]

02:38.620 --> 02:39.620
[snoring]
[打鼾]

02:39.655 --> 02:40.758
[boink]
[乱搞]

02:40.793 --> 02:42.379
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

02:42.413 --> 02:44.758
- AAAAAaaaaaooo.
- 啊啊啊啊啊啊。

02:44.793 --> 02:46.724
WHEH...HEH.
什...呵呵。

02:46.758 --> 02:47.758
IT'S JUST NOT THE SAME
WITHOUT PATRICK
只是不一样
没有帕特里克

02:47.793 --> 02:50.758
PLAYING ALONG, TOO.
也一起玩。

02:50.793 --> 02:53.206
[donk donk]
[咚咚咚]

02:53.241 --> 02:54.482
ALL RIGHT, PATRICK.
好吧，帕特里克。

02:54.517 --> 02:56.827
YOU LEAVE ME NO CHOICE.
你让我别无选择。

02:56.862 --> 02:58.827
[poink poink]
[点点]

02:58.862 --> 03:00.103
- YEOOOOW!
- 是啊！

03:00.137 --> 03:02.241
WHAT'S THE BIG IDEA?
有什么好主意？

03:02.275 --> 03:04.448
- PATRICK!
YOU HAVE A BEARD!
- 帕特里克！
你有胡子！

03:04.482 --> 03:07.655
- I DO?
- 我愿意？

03:07.689 --> 03:10.275
- YOU SURE LOOK GROWN UP
WITH THAT NEW BEARD.
- 你看起来确实长大了
留着新胡子。

03:10.310 --> 03:11.586
- WOW.
- 哇。

03:11.620 --> 03:13.103
YOU REALLY THINK SO?
你真的这么认为吗？

03:13.137 --> 03:15.000
- AND EVERYBODY KNOWS
THAT GROWN-UPS
- 每个人都知道
那个大人

03:15.034 --> 03:17.068
NEVER PLAY WITH KIDS.
切勿与孩子一起玩耍。

03:17.103 --> 03:18.448
AND ON THAT NOTE,
关于这一点，

03:18.482 --> 03:20.241
I WOULD LIKE
TO PERSONALLY COMMEND
我想要
个人推荐

03:20.275 --> 03:22.862
THE SEA STAR FOR TAKING
HIS FIRST BABY STEPS
可供捕捉的海星
他的第一步

03:22.896 --> 03:25.482
INTO THE ADULT WORLD.
进入成人世界。

03:25.517 --> 03:27.206
FACIAL HAIR IS A GOOD START,
I SUPPOSE.
面部毛发是一个好的开始，
我想。

03:27.241 --> 03:29.931
- I AM CURIOUS TO KNOW
- 我很想知道

03:29.965 --> 03:33.482
WHAT MATURE PEOPLE
LIKE SQUIDWARD DO.
什么是成熟的人
就像《章鱼哥》一样。

03:33.517 --> 03:35.275
WOULD YOU SHOW ME?
你能给我看看吗？

03:35.310 --> 03:36.275
- SHOW YOU?
- 给你看？

03:36.310 --> 03:37.931
- SHOW ME, SHOW ME!
- 给我看，给我看！

03:37.965 --> 03:39.275
PUH-PLEASE, PLEASE, PLEA--
PRETTY PLEASE?
噗-求你了，求你了，求你了——
漂亮吗？

03:39.310 --> 03:40.275
PRETTY PLEASE?
漂亮吗？

03:40.310 --> 03:41.310
- [sighs]
- [叹气]

03:41.344 --> 03:43.517
I KNOW I'M GONNA REGRET THIS.
我知道我会后悔的。

03:43.551 --> 03:45.758
ALL RIGHT,
I WILL TAKE ON THIS MISSION.
好吧，
我将承担这个使命。

03:45.793 --> 03:47.448
- HOORAY!
- 万岁！

03:47.482 --> 03:50.000
- IN THE HOPE THAT A QUIET,
GROWN-UP NEIGHBORHOOD
- 希望安静，
成人社区

03:50.034 --> 03:52.310
WILL PREVAIL AT LAST,
最终将获胜，

03:52.344 --> 03:54.896
MOVING ME ONE STEP CLOSER
TO PEACE
让我更近一步
走向和平

03:54.931 --> 03:57.137
AND BLESSED TRANQUILITY.
和有福的安宁。

03:57.172 --> 03:58.448
A PLACE WHERE
AT LAST I CAN--
一个地方
我终于可以——

03:58.482 --> 04:00.379
- OH, OH, OH, OH!
OH, OH, OH!
- 哦，哦，哦，哦！
哦，哦，哦！

04:00.413 --> 04:02.068
OH, OH, OH,
OH, OH, OH, OH!
哦，哦，哦，
哦，哦，哦，哦！

04:02.103 --> 04:03.862
OH, OH, OH, OH, OH, OH,
OH, OH, OH, OH, OH, OH OH--
哦，哦，哦，哦，哦，哦，
哦哦哦哦哦哦——

04:03.896 --> 04:05.586
- WHAT?!
- 什么？！

04:05.620 --> 04:07.655
- MAY I TAG ALONG
AND OBSERVE YOUR INSTRUCTION?
- 我可以跟着吗
并遵守您的指示？

04:07.689 --> 04:11.413
- WHY IN A MILLION YEARS
WOULD I LET YOUTAG ALONG?
- 为什么在一百万年后
我会让你跟着我吗？

04:11.448 --> 04:13.103
- BECAUSE MAYBE SOME
OF YOUR LESSONS IN MATURITY
- 因为也许有些
你成熟的教训

04:13.137 --> 04:14.482
WILL RUB OFF ON ME,
会影响我，

04:14.517 --> 04:16.551
BRINGING US TWOSTEPS CLOSER
让我们更加接近

04:16.586 --> 04:17.896
TO A QUIET,
GROWN-UP NEIGHBORHOOD.
为了安静，
成人社区。

04:17.931 --> 04:20.310
- WOW.
THAT ACTUALLY MADE SENSE.
- 哇。
这确实有道理。

04:20.344 --> 04:21.965
IT MUST BE WORKING ALREADY.
它必须已经可以工作了。

04:22.000 --> 04:23.000
- IS THAT A YES?
- 这是肯定的吗？

04:23.034 --> 04:25.241
- OH, HMM...
- 哦，嗯……

04:25.275 --> 04:27.620
LET ME ESCORT YOU
TO MY PLACE,
让我护送你
到我的地方，

04:27.655 --> 04:29.137
MY GOOD SIR.
我的好先生。

04:29.172 --> 04:30.896
WE'LL NEED TO START
WITH PERSONAL GROOMING
我们需要开始
个人仪容仪表

04:30.931 --> 04:33.034
FOR YOUR GROWN-UP MAKEOVER.
为您的成人改头换面。

04:33.068 --> 04:34.034
[snap!]
[折断！]

04:34.068 --> 04:35.724
- SOUNDS GOOD TO ME.
- 听起来不错。

04:35.758 --> 04:37.965
- WE MAY HAVE TO FIND YOU
SOME NEW CLOTHES AS WELL.
- 我们可能必须找到你
还有一些新衣服。

04:38.000 --> 04:39.379
- NEW CLOTHES?
- 新衣服？

04:39.413 --> 04:40.862
- TO GO ALONG
WITH YOUR NEW BEARD,
- 一起去
有了你的新胡子，

04:40.896 --> 04:43.793
WHICH MAKES YOU LOOK
VERY DISTINGUISHED.
这让你看起来
非常杰出。

04:43.827 --> 04:45.965
- DISTINGUISHED.
- 杰出的。

04:46.000 --> 04:48.275
- ALL RIGHT!
DISTINGUISHED.
- 好的！
杰出的。

04:48.310 --> 04:49.448
- YEAH, HUH, HUH.
- 是啊，呵呵。

04:49.482 --> 04:50.689
- EXCUSE ME.
- 打扰一下。

04:50.724 --> 04:53.517
GROWN-UPS DO NOT HIGH-FIVE.
大人不会击掌。

04:53.551 --> 04:57.482
- OH, RIGHT.
- 哦，对了。

04:57.517 --> 05:01.172
- [laughing]
- [笑]

05:04.379 --> 05:06.103
[singing video game sounds]
[唱歌视频游戏声音]

05:06.137 --> 05:09.482
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

05:09.517 --> 05:16.517
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪

05:16.551 --> 05:18.137
SO, UM,
WHAT DO YOU GUYS THINK?
那么，嗯，
你们觉得怎么样？

05:18.172 --> 05:19.137
HUH?
嗯？

05:19.172 --> 05:20.275
SWEET DUDS, HUH, PATRICK?
可爱的家伙，嗯，帕特里克？

05:20.310 --> 05:21.275
- THEY SURE ARE.
- 他们确实是。

05:21.310 --> 05:22.310
- AHEM.
- 咳咳。

05:22.344 --> 05:24.689
- FOR A BABY.
- 给婴儿。

05:24.724 --> 05:28.103
- WELL PLAYED, PATRICK.
WELL PLAYED.
- 打得好，帕特里克。
打的好。

05:28.137 --> 05:31.344
[peaceful classical music]
【宁静的古典音乐】

05:31.379 --> 05:33.586
- MAY I TAKE
YOUR HAT AND CANE, SIR?
- 我可以服用吗
先生，您的帽子和手杖吗？

05:33.620 --> 05:35.793
[mature voice]
- WHY, CERTAINLY.
[成熟的声音]
- 为什么，当然。

05:35.827 --> 05:37.137
- ENJOY YOUR EVENING,
GENTLEMEN.
- 享受你的夜晚，
先生们。

05:37.172 --> 05:38.137
- OHHHHH...
- 哦哦哦...

05:38.172 --> 05:39.206
♪ HA CHA TA
♪ 哈恰恰

05:39.241 --> 05:40.620
♪ HA CHA-CHA
♪ 哈恰恰

05:40.655 --> 05:42.034
♪ RAZZMATAZZ
AND A RINKETY DINK ♪
♪ 拉兹马塔兹
还有一杯丁克酒 ♪

05:42.068 --> 05:43.827
♪ A RINKADINK
A DOODLY DOO ♪
♪ 林卡丁克
一个可爱的杜奥♪

05:43.862 --> 05:45.517
- OH, NO.
- 哦，不。

05:45.551 --> 05:47.482
[peaceful classical music]
【宁静的古典音乐】

05:47.517 --> 05:50.620
- APPETIZERS.
- 开胃菜。

05:50.655 --> 05:53.068
- OH, BOY, EATS!
- 哦，男孩，吃吧！

05:53.103 --> 05:54.758
YUM, YUM, YUM.
百胜，百胜，百胜。

05:54.793 --> 05:58.482
- AND WE ALSO HAVE
MILK AND COOKIES.
- 我们还有
牛奶和饼干。

05:58.517 --> 05:59.931
[crunching]
[嘎吱嘎吱]

05:59.965 --> 06:01.931
- OH! ARE THOSE
CHOCOLATE CHIP COOKIES?
- 哦！是那些吗
巧克力饼干？

06:01.965 --> 06:03.413
CAN I--
- PATRICK!
我可以——
- 帕特里克！

06:03.448 --> 06:05.758
I'M SURE YOU'D RATHER HAVE
SOME TETRAZZINI
我确定你更愿意
一些四磨石

06:05.793 --> 06:07.827
WE GROWN-UPSORDERED,
RIGHT?
我们成长得井井有条，
对吗？

06:07.862 --> 06:10.448
- DAH...YES, SQUIDWARD.
- DAH...是的，章鱼哥。

06:10.482 --> 06:12.103
I'M FRANKLY SHOCKED
THEY SERVE
坦白说我很震惊
他们服务

06:12.137 --> 06:14.379
SUCH ELEMENTARY FARE HERE.
这里的基本费用。

06:14.413 --> 06:16.172
- INDEED.
- 的确。

06:16.206 --> 06:20.344
AND MY PERSONAL FAVORITE PIECE
IS THIS LOVELY STATUE
以及我个人最喜欢的作品
这是可爱的雕像吗

06:20.379 --> 06:21.413
FROM THE REEFAISSANCE ERA.
来自 Refaisance 时代。

06:21.448 --> 06:23.758
- BOOOORING.
- 嘘声。

06:23.793 --> 06:24.758
- BORING?
- 无聊的？

06:24.793 --> 06:26.275
- UH, I--NO.
- 呃，我——不。

06:26.310 --> 06:29.586
I SAID, "FLOOOOOORING."
我说：“滚。”

06:29.620 --> 06:34.551
THE FLOORING COMPLEMENTS
THE ARTWORK HERE EXQUISITELY.
地板的补充
这里的艺术品精美绝伦。

06:34.586 --> 06:36.551
- YES, WELL,
I SUPPOSE IT DOES.
- 是的，嗯，
我想是的。

06:36.586 --> 06:38.068
- BAH, AH, AH, AH, AH, AH!
- 呸，啊，啊，啊，啊，啊！

06:38.103 --> 06:41.896
- SPONGEBOB, GET DOWN FROM THERE
RIGHT NOW!
- 海绵宝宝，从那里下来
现在！

06:41.931 --> 06:44.724
- WOW!
[whump!]
- 哇！
[重击！]

06:44.758 --> 06:45.724
[squeak]
[吱]

06:45.758 --> 06:47.103
[pop!]
[流行音乐！]

06:47.137 --> 06:48.482
- DON'T WORRY, GUYS.
I'M OKAY.
- 别担心，伙计们。
我没事。

06:48.517 --> 06:51.379
REALLY, I'M OOOOOKAY.
真的，我很好。

06:57.896 --> 06:59.137
[splat]
[啪嗒]

06:59.172 --> 07:00.620
THERE.
GOOD AS NE--
那里。
一如既往的好--

07:00.655 --> 07:02.482
OH, OH!
哦，哦！

07:02.517 --> 07:05.206
[horn honks]
[喇叭鸣响]

07:05.241 --> 07:07.344
[whistling]
[吹口哨]

07:10.931 --> 07:12.862
ALL FIXED, GUYS.
一切都已修复，伙计们。

07:12.896 --> 07:14.413
- SECURITY!
- 安全！

07:14.448 --> 07:17.965
- PLEASE BE GENTLE.
- 请温柔一点。

07:18.000 --> 07:19.689
HUH, THAT'S WEIRD.
嗯，这很奇怪。

07:19.724 --> 07:20.965
I THOUGHT I WAS GONNA GET
TOSSED OUT ON MY--
我以为我会得到
被扔到我的——

07:21.000 --> 07:23.620
AAAAAAGH!
WOW.
啊啊啊！
哇。

07:23.655 --> 07:25.862
[squeak]
[吱]

07:25.896 --> 07:29.310
- PATRICK STAR,
I AM VERY PROUD
- 帕特里克·斯塔，
我非常自豪

07:29.344 --> 07:30.758
OF WHAT YOU DID IN THERE.
你在那里所做的事情。

07:30.793 --> 07:32.827
YOU KNOW, THAT BEARD
WAS THE BEST THING
你知道，那胡子
是最好的事情

07:32.862 --> 07:35.068
THAT'S EVER HAPPENED TO YOU.
这种事曾经发生在你身上。

07:35.103 --> 07:37.655
WELL, OTHER THAN ME,
OF COURSE, HA.
好吧，除了我之外，
当然，哈。

07:37.689 --> 07:41.241
- THAT BEARD.
I MUST REMOVE THAT BEARD.
- 那胡子。
我必须把胡子去掉。

07:41.275 --> 07:42.724
REMOVE BEARD,
去除胡须，

07:42.758 --> 07:45.000
RESTORE FRIENDSHIP!
恢复友谊！

07:45.034 --> 07:46.620
- AND THAT'S WHEN
I TOLD THEM,
- 就在那时
我告诉他们，

07:46.655 --> 07:48.586
LOOK, IF I WANTED
TO STAND AROUND--
看看，如果我愿意的话
TO STAND AROUND--

07:48.620 --> 07:50.551
- THAT'S IT!
- 就是这样！

07:50.586 --> 07:52.344
IT MUST BE DONE.
必须完成。

07:52.379 --> 07:53.689
- SPONGEBOB!
- 海绵宝宝！

07:53.724 --> 07:55.827
THE ONLY THING
THAT MUST BE DONE
唯一的事情
这是必须要做的

07:55.862 --> 07:57.310
IS CUTTING THE CORD
WITH YOU.
正在切断电源线
和你在一起。

07:57.344 --> 07:58.379
- NO, PLEASE.
- 不，请。

07:58.413 --> 08:00.827
- LOOK, MR. BABYPANTS.
- 看，先生。婴儿裤。

08:00.862 --> 08:03.517
IT IS GLARINGLY CLEAR
THAT YOU LEARNED NOTHING TODAY
显而易见
你今天什么也没学到

08:03.551 --> 08:05.310
ABOUT HOW TO BE MATURE.
关于如何变得成熟。

08:05.344 --> 08:06.862
- BUT--
- NO BUTS.
-但是--
- 没有屁股。

08:06.896 --> 08:09.344
WE ARE THROUGH ENTERTAINING
YOUR COMPANY.
我们通过娱乐
您的公司。

08:09.379 --> 08:10.517
SHALL WE?
我们可以？

08:10.551 --> 08:12.724
- LET'S SHALL.
- 让我们吧。

08:12.758 --> 08:15.034
- PATRICK, DON'T LEAVE ME.
- 帕特里克，别离开我。

08:15.068 --> 08:16.137
[clunk]
[沉闷]

08:16.172 --> 08:17.896
- OH.
- 哦。

08:17.931 --> 08:19.310
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

08:19.344 --> 08:21.793
WHY ARE THERE SO MANY STAIRS?
为什么有这么多楼梯？

08:21.827 --> 08:23.827
- YOU'VE ONLY GONE UP
THREE STEPS.
- 你只是上升了
三步。

08:23.862 --> 08:25.689
- WELL, IT FEELS LIKE FOUR.
- 嗯，感觉像是四个。

08:25.724 --> 08:27.068
- WE ARE ABOUT TO ENTER
- 我们即将进入

08:27.103 --> 08:28.793
THE PINNACLE
OF GROWN-UP CULTURE
巅峰之作
成人文化

08:28.827 --> 08:30.551
HERE IN BIKINI BOTTOM.
这里是比基尼泳裤。

08:30.586 --> 08:35.241
ALSO KNOWN AS THE FAMED
BIKINI BOTTOM OPERA HOUSE.
也被称为著名的
BIKINI BOTTOM OPERA HOUSE.

08:39.482 --> 08:40.620
- WHAT?
- NOTHING.
- 什么？
- 没有什么。

08:40.655 --> 08:42.448
LET'S GO FIND OUR SEATS.
我们去找座位吧。

08:42.482 --> 08:44.724
[crowd murmuring,
instruments tuning up]
[人群窃窃私语，
乐器调音]

08:44.758 --> 08:46.724
- HEY, ALL RIGHT!
BOX SEATS!
- 嘿，好吧！
包厢座位！

08:46.758 --> 08:48.068
UH, I MEAN,
呃，我的意思是，

08:48.103 --> 08:51.241
THIS SEAT CHOICE
IS MOST MATURE.
此座位选择
是最成熟的。

08:51.275 --> 08:54.758
CERTAINLY MORE SO
THAN THAT RAPSCALLION SPONGE,
当然更是如此
THAN THAT RAPSCALLION SPONGE,

08:54.793 --> 08:56.724
WHOSE NAME
WE SHALL NOT MENTION,
谁的名字
我们不会提及，

08:56.758 --> 08:58.275
WOULD HAVE PICKED.
会选择的。

08:58.310 --> 09:03.310
- CERTAINLY.
- 当然。

09:03.344 --> 09:04.482
[grand classical music]
【宏大古典音乐】

09:04.517 --> 09:06.896
- ♪ LA-LA-LA LAAAAAA ♪
- ♪ 啦啦啦啦啦啦啦 ♪

09:06.931 --> 09:10.068
[applause]
[掌声]

09:10.103 --> 09:13.827
- A MOST EXEMPLARY PERFORMANCE.
UH--
- 最出色的表现。
呃--

09:13.862 --> 09:16.172
- OH, OH, IT GETS EVEN MORE
THRILLING FROM HERE.
- 哦，哦，还有更多
从这里开始激动人心。

09:20.827 --> 09:21.931
- WHAT THE--?!
- 什么--？！

09:21.965 --> 09:23.793
- SHE'S BEAUTIFUL.
- 她很漂亮。

09:23.827 --> 09:26.896
[change jingling]
【变叮当】

09:26.931 --> 09:30.068
- THERE ONCE WAS A MAN
FROM NANTUCKET.
- 从前有一个人
来自楠塔基特岛。

09:30.103 --> 09:31.068
[crowd gasps]
[人群喘息]

09:31.103 --> 09:32.068
OOPS, SORRY, WRONG ONE.
哎呀，抱歉，发错了。

09:32.103 --> 09:34.103
[crowd murmuring]
[人群窃窃私语]

09:34.137 --> 09:35.862
AHEM!
咳咳！

09:35.896 --> 09:37.448
[soft classical music]
[轻柔的古典音乐]

09:37.482 --> 09:39.241
[beautiful soprano voice]
♪ DEAR FRIEND
[优美的女高音]
♪ DEAR FRIEND

09:39.275 --> 09:43.896
♪ DON'T SAY THAT IT'S
ALL OVER ♪
♪ 别这么说
全部结束♪

09:43.931 --> 09:46.620
♪ AS LONG AS I BREATHE
♪ 只要我呼吸

09:46.655 --> 09:50.310
♪ I WILL CHERISH OUR BOND
♪ 我会珍惜我们的纽带

09:50.344 --> 09:51.758
- TERRIBLE.
- 糟糕的。

09:51.793 --> 09:54.206
- ♪ DEAR FRIEND
- ♪ 亲爱的朋友

09:54.241 --> 09:58.172
♪ DON'T SAY THAT IT'S
ALL OVER ♪
♪ 别这么说
全部结束♪

09:58.206 --> 09:59.931
♪ MY HEART BOUNCES
ON ROCKS ♪
♪ 我的心在跳动
在岩石上 ♪

09:59.965 --> 10:01.862
♪ JAGGED AND GRAY
♪ 锯齿状和灰色

10:01.896 --> 10:03.965
- [whimpering]
- [呜咽]

10:04.000 --> 10:07.068
- ♪ DEAR FRIEND
- ♪ 亲爱的朋友

10:07.103 --> 10:11.827
♪ DON'T SAY THAT IT'S
ALL OOOOOOVER ♪
♪ 别这么说
一切都结束了 ♪

10:11.862 --> 10:15.103
♪ LET'S STAY PALS
♪ 我们还是朋友吧

10:15.137 --> 10:20.413
♪ WHAT DOOOOOOOOOO
♪ 做什么

10:20.448 --> 10:26.241
♪ YOU SAAAAAAAAY ♪
♪ 你啊啊啊啊 ♪

10:26.275 --> 10:27.793
- [sobbing]
- [抽泣]

10:31.793 --> 10:33.344
- HEY!
- 嘿！

10:33.379 --> 10:35.862
HOW'S A SEA URCHIN SUPPOSED
TO GET ANY SLEEP
海胆是怎样的
为了获得睡眠

10:35.896 --> 10:38.517
WITH ALL THESE SALTY TEARS
FALLING ON HIM?
带着所有这些咸味的眼泪
FALLING ON HIM?

10:38.551 --> 10:42.206
I GOTTA GET OUT OF HERE.
我得离开这里。

10:42.241 --> 10:43.241
[boing]
[嗡嗡声]

10:43.275 --> 10:44.379
'SCUSE ME.
对不起。

10:44.413 --> 10:45.482
COMIN' THROUGH.
即将过去。

10:45.517 --> 10:47.034
HEY, WATCH IT, MISTER.
嘿，注意点，先生。

10:47.068 --> 10:49.758
SAY, LADY, HOW DO I GET
OUTTA THIS JOINT?
说，女士，我怎样才能得到
离开这个关节？

10:49.793 --> 10:51.931
- EXIT STAGE LEFT
IS THATAWAY.
- 离开舞台左侧
就是这样。

10:51.965 --> 10:53.517
- THANKS, CUTIE.
NICE HAT.
- 谢谢，可爱。
漂亮的帽子。

10:53.551 --> 10:54.827
- HEY, STOP THAT BEARD!
- 嘿，别留胡子了！

10:54.862 --> 10:56.655
- PATRICK, IT'S NOT A BEARD.
- 帕特里克，这不是胡子。

10:56.689 --> 10:58.758
IT'S A SEA URCHIN.
这是海胆。

10:58.793 --> 11:00.448
IT MUST HAVE BEEN SLEEPING
ON YOUR FACE
它一定是在睡觉
在你的脸上

11:00.482 --> 11:02.655
UNTIL YOUR TEARS AWOKE IT
FROM ITS HIBERNATION.
直到你的眼泪唤醒它
从冬眠开始。

11:02.689 --> 11:05.137
- HOW DO YOU KNOW MY NAME?
- 你怎么知道我的名字？

11:05.172 --> 11:06.931
- BECAUSE, MR. PATRICK STAR,
- 因为，先生。帕特里克·斯塔，

11:06.965 --> 11:08.275
YOU TOLD ME.
你告诉我的。

11:08.310 --> 11:10.482
- SPONGEBOB!
- 海绵宝宝！

11:10.517 --> 11:12.896
- PATRICK!
- 帕特里克！

11:12.931 --> 11:15.344
- OH, PLEASE,
YOU CAN CALL ME PATRICK.
- 哦，拜托，
YOU CAN CALL ME PATRICK.

11:15.379 --> 11:18.724
- [cheering]
- [欢呼]

11:18.758 --> 11:21.275
- [laughing]
- [笑]

11:21.310 --> 11:23.172
- QUIET!
HOLD IT!
- 安静的！
坚持住！

11:23.206 --> 11:24.620
STOP IT RIGHT THERE.
就在那里停下来。

11:24.655 --> 11:27.517
I AM ASHAMED AND DISGUSTED
BY YOU PEOPLE.
我感到羞愧和厌恶
由你们。

11:27.551 --> 11:30.655
I MEAN, DON'T YOU KNOW
A TERRIBLE PERFORMANCE
我的意思是，你不知道吗
糟糕的表现

11:30.689 --> 11:31.758
WHEN YOU SEE IT?
当你看到它时？

11:31.793 --> 11:34.586
- YES, WE DO.
- 是的，我们愿意。

11:34.620 --> 11:36.551
- THAT'S WHAT I THOUGHT YOU--
- 这就是我想你的--

11:36.586 --> 11:37.931
NO, NO, NO,
I DIDN'T MEAN IT LIKE THAT.
不，不，不，
我不是这个意思。

11:37.965 --> 11:38.931
IT WAS A--
这是A--

11:38.965 --> 11:41.137
[crowd shouting]
[人群喊叫]

11:41.172 --> 11:43.862
- [laughing]
- [笑]

11:43.896 --> 11:46.206
FOOD FIGHT!
食物大战！

12:02.137 --> 12:05.758
[threatening music]
[威胁性音乐]

12:05.793 --> 12:13.655
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪

12:19.275 --> 12:23.931
- SPONGEBOB, WHY AREN'T THOSE
ORDERS UP YET?
- 海绵宝宝，为什么不是那些
订单还没有完成吗？

12:23.965 --> 12:27.793
- [growling]
- [咆哮]

12:27.827 --> 12:30.034
- SPONGEBOB, THE COLLECTIVE
BLOOD SUGAR OUT HERE
- 海绵宝宝，集体
血糖在这里

12:30.068 --> 12:32.517
IS GETTING DANGEROUSLY LOW.
正变得危险地低。

12:32.551 --> 12:35.586
WHY ARE YOU GRILLING
INDEX CARDS?
你为什么要烧烤
索引卡？

12:35.620 --> 12:36.586
- SORRY, SQUIDWARD.
- 对不起，章鱼哥。

12:36.620 --> 12:37.931
I GOT A LITTLE DISTRACTED.
我有点心烦意乱。

12:37.965 --> 12:39.275
I'M PRACTICING
MY ORAL REPORT
我正在练习
我的口头报告

12:39.310 --> 12:40.586
FOR BOATING SCHOOL TOMORROW.
明天的划船学校。

12:40.620 --> 12:42.000
- YOU KNOW, SPONGEBOB,
- 你知道，海绵宝宝，

12:42.034 --> 12:43.931
STATISTICS SHOW
THAT PUBLIC SPEAKING
统计数据显示
公开演讲

12:43.965 --> 12:46.655
IS THE NUMBER THREE CAUSE
OF STRESS,
是第三个原因
压力，

12:46.689 --> 12:48.241
RIGHT BEHIND DEATH
AND MARRIAGE.
死亡背后
还有婚姻。

12:48.275 --> 12:49.517
NOW, GET THOSE ORDERS READY!
现在，准备好这些订单！

12:49.551 --> 12:51.517
- OKAY, OKAY!
- 好吧，好吧！

12:51.551 --> 12:54.793
HMPH, WHAT'S SO SCARY
ABOUT PUBLIC SPEAKING, ANYWAY?
哼，有什么可怕的
无论如何，关于公开演讲？

12:54.827 --> 12:56.172
YOU JUST STAND
IN FRONT OF THE PUBLIC
你只要站着
在公众面前

12:56.206 --> 12:58.758
AND SPEAK PUBLICALLY.
并公开演讲。

12:58.793 --> 13:00.896
IT'S REALLY NO DIFFERENT THAN
WHAT I DO EVERY DAY.
这真的没有什么不同
我每天都做什么。

13:00.931 --> 13:02.172
[alarm sounds]
[警报声]

13:02.206 --> 13:04.310
[evil music]
[邪恶的音乐]

13:04.344 --> 13:05.862
NO BIG DEAL, SPONGEBOB.
没什么大不了的，海绵宝宝。

13:05.896 --> 13:07.344
YOU JUST STAND
IN FRONT OF 'EM...
你只要站着
在他们面前...

13:07.379 --> 13:09.310
- [growling]
- [咆哮]

13:09.344 --> 13:10.689
- ALL OF 'EM...
- 他们所有人...

13:10.724 --> 13:12.034
LOOKING...
正在寻找...

13:12.068 --> 13:13.965
AT ME...
在我身上...

13:14.000 --> 13:15.275
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

13:15.310 --> 13:16.724
- WITH THEIR EYES!
YEEEEOOOOW!
- 用他们的眼睛！
呀呀呀呀！

13:16.758 --> 13:17.724
SQUIDWARD WAS RIGHT.
章鱼哥是对的。

13:17.758 --> 13:19.241
PUBLIC SPEAKING IS FRIGHTENING.
公开演讲令人恐惧。

13:19.275 --> 13:21.655
- MUST I DO EVERYTHING
MYSELF?
- 我必须做所有事情吗
我自己？

13:21.689 --> 13:23.586
AH, STAY BACK.
啊，退后一步。

13:23.620 --> 13:25.344
YOU'LL GET YOUR PATTY
WHEN IT'S YOUR TURN.
你会得到你的肉饼
当轮到你的时候。

13:25.379 --> 13:28.551
[grunts and thumps]
[咕哝声和重击声]

13:28.586 --> 13:31.275
[glass shatters]
[玻璃碎裂]

13:31.310 --> 13:33.172
- I NEVER KNEW AN AUDIENCE
COULD GET SO PHYSICAL.
- 我从来不认识观众
可以变得如此体力。

13:33.206 --> 13:34.172
[blood-curdling scream]
[令人毛骨悚然的尖叫声]

13:34.206 --> 13:35.206
[whang!]
[哇！]

13:35.241 --> 13:36.310
[glass shatters]
[玻璃碎裂]

13:36.344 --> 13:38.758
THIS CHANGES EVERYTHING.
这改变了一切。

13:38.793 --> 13:40.034
- YA-HOOOO!
- 呀呼！

13:40.068 --> 13:44.413
OW, OW!
噢，噢！

13:44.448 --> 13:48.034
- OH, SORRY.
WRONG ROCK.
- 哦，抱歉。
错误的岩石。

13:48.068 --> 13:49.551
- PATRICK, I WONDER
IF YOU'D HELP ME
- 帕特里克，我想知道
如果你愿意帮助我

13:49.586 --> 13:50.827
BY LENDING ME YOUR EYES.
把你的眼睛借给我。

13:50.862 --> 13:52.137
- OKAY.
- 好的。

13:52.172 --> 13:53.620
[screaming]
[尖叫]

13:53.655 --> 13:55.379
- NO, NO, NO, NO, NO.
YOU CAN KEEP 'EM.
- 不，不，不，不，不。
你可以保留它们。

13:55.413 --> 13:56.793
I JUST WANT YOU
TO WATCH ME
我只想要你
看着我

13:56.827 --> 13:58.310
WHILE I PRACTICE MY SPEECH
UP HERE.
当我练习演讲时
在这里。

13:58.344 --> 13:59.586
JUST PRETEND YOU'RE A STUDENT
AT HIS DESK.
假装你是一名学生
在他的办公桌前。

13:59.620 --> 14:02.413
- OKAY.
- 好的。

14:02.448 --> 14:04.827
HOLD--HOLD--HOLD ON.
坚持——坚持——坚持。

14:04.862 --> 14:07.724
I LIKE TO SIT
IN THE BACK OF THE CLASS.
我喜欢坐着
在教室后面。

14:07.758 --> 14:09.620
[screeching]
[尖叫声]

14:12.965 --> 14:15.103
[screech]
[尖叫]

14:15.137 --> 14:16.551
[squeak]
[吱]

14:16.586 --> 14:17.862
- OKAY, HERE GOES.
- 好的，开始了。

14:17.896 --> 14:19.448
BOATING SAFETY I--
划船安全一--

14:19.482 --> 14:20.448
- SPONGEBOB!
- 海绵宝宝！

14:20.482 --> 14:22.068
CAN I HAVE A HALL PASS?
我可以有大厅通行证吗？

14:22.103 --> 14:23.413
- OH, NOT NOW, PATRICK.
- 哦，现在不行，帕特里克。

14:23.448 --> 14:25.034
JUST SIT TIGHT
AND LET ME PRACTICE.
坐稳
让我练习一下。

14:25.068 --> 14:26.931
- FINE.
- AHEM. BOATING SAFE--
- 美好的。
- 咳咳。划船安全--

14:26.965 --> 14:28.793
- BORING!
NEXT.
- 无聊的！
下一个。

14:28.827 --> 14:29.896
- PATRICK,
YOU'RE KIND OF DERAILING
- 帕特里克，
你有点脱轨了

14:29.931 --> 14:31.206
THE PROCEEDINGS HERE.
诉讼程序在这里。

14:31.241 --> 14:32.586
UH, JUST FOCUS ON ME, HUH?
呃，只关注我吧？

14:32.620 --> 14:35.000
- ALL RIGHT, ALL RIGHT.
- 好吧，好吧。

14:37.344 --> 14:39.068
- SO, WITHOUT FURTHER ADIEU--
- 所以，没有进一步的再见--

14:39.103 --> 14:42.172
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

14:42.206 --> 14:43.172
- PATRICK.
- 帕特里克。

14:43.206 --> 14:44.931
PATRICK, WAKE UP.
帕特里克，醒醒。

14:44.965 --> 14:47.103
WHAT HAPPENED, PATRICK?
发生了什么事，帕特里克？

14:47.137 --> 14:49.137
- OH, COME ON, SPONGEBOB.
- 哦，来吧，海绵宝宝。

14:49.172 --> 14:50.241
YOU THINK EVERYONE
CAN STAY AWAKE
你以为每个人
可以保持清醒

14:50.275 --> 14:51.586
FOR YOUR BORING SPEECH?
为了你无聊的演讲？

14:51.620 --> 14:53.103
- I DON'T KNOW.
- 我不知道。

14:53.137 --> 14:54.413
DO YOU THINK THAT'S TOO MUCH
TO EXPECT?
你认为这太过分了吗
期待吗？

14:54.448 --> 14:55.862
- YES!
- 是的！

14:55.896 --> 14:57.689
AND YOU SHOULD BE PREPARED
FOR WORSE.
你应该做好准备
更糟糕的是。

14:57.724 --> 14:58.689
- WORSE?
- 更糟？

14:58.724 --> 15:00.137
- YOU'RE GONNA HAVE THINGS
- 你将会拥有一些东西

15:00.172 --> 15:01.586
THROWN AT YOU
YOU WOULDN'T BELIEVE.
扔给你
你不会相信。

15:01.620 --> 15:02.724
YOU BETTER BE READY!
你最好做好准备！

15:02.758 --> 15:04.000
NOW, TRY AGAIN.
现在，再试一次。

15:04.034 --> 15:05.000
- OKAY.
- 好的。

15:05.034 --> 15:06.655
[militant music]
[激进的音乐]

15:06.689 --> 15:09.275
- BOATING SAFETY--
- 划船安全--

15:09.310 --> 15:11.344
BOATING SAFE--
划船安全--

15:11.379 --> 15:13.275
- THAT'S IT!
- 就是这样！

15:13.310 --> 15:14.862
FIGHT THROUGH!
战斗到底！

15:14.896 --> 15:16.172
- UGH!
AGH!
- 呃！
哎哟！

15:16.206 --> 15:17.931
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

15:17.965 --> 15:20.344
PATRICK, NOBODY THROWS PILLOWS
IN CLASS.
帕特里克，没有人扔枕头
在课堂上。

15:20.379 --> 15:21.896
- SAYS YOU!
SPEECH!
- 你说！
演讲！

15:21.931 --> 15:23.379
- BOATING SAFE--
- 划船安全--

15:23.413 --> 15:24.896
[girly voice]
- SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS.
[少女声音]
- 海绵宝宝。

15:24.931 --> 15:27.551
WHAT A MESS YOU'VE MADE
OF MY CLASSROOM.
你把事情搞得一团糟
我的教室。

15:27.586 --> 15:29.517
- UH, YOU SORTA HAD
A HAND IN THAT TOO, PATRICK.
- 呃，你有点有
帕特里克也参与其中。

15:29.551 --> 15:33.034
- YOUNG MAN, HOW DARE YOU?
- 年轻人，你怎么敢？

15:33.068 --> 15:35.482
- WHAT--
A DETENTION SLIP?
- 什么--
拘留单？

15:35.517 --> 15:37.965
- I'M NOT HEARING
YOUR ORAL REPORT.
- 我没听见
你的口头报告。

15:38.000 --> 15:40.448
- OKAY.
BOATING SAFETY--
- 好的。
划船安全--

15:40.482 --> 15:41.586
[shoes squeaking]
[鞋子吱吱作响]

15:41.620 --> 15:42.655
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

15:42.689 --> 15:44.034
- TRY AGAIN.
- 再试一次。

15:44.068 --> 15:45.517
- [panting]
BOATING...SAFETY...
- [气喘吁吁]
划船...安全...

15:45.551 --> 15:48.068
[crash!]
[碰撞！]

15:48.103 --> 15:49.689
- COME ON, SQUAREPANTS!
- 来吧，方裤们！

15:49.724 --> 15:51.448
IS THIS THE BEST
YOU CAN DO?
这是最好的吗
你能做吗？

15:51.482 --> 15:54.655
- PATRICK, SOMEHOW I DON'T THINK
THIS IS WORKING.
- 帕特里克，不知怎的，我不这么认为
这是有效的。

15:58.724 --> 16:00.206
- SPEECH!
- WAAAHHH!
- 演讲！
- 哇啊啊啊！

16:00.241 --> 16:01.689
- SPEECH, SPEECH, SPEECH!
SPEECH, SPEECH!
- 演讲，演讲，演讲！
演讲，演讲！

16:01.724 --> 16:03.724
SPEECH, SPEECH, SPEECH!
演讲，演讲，演讲！

16:03.758 --> 16:05.241
SPEECH, SPEECH!
SPEECH, SPEECH, SPEECH!
演讲，演讲！
演讲，演讲，演讲！

16:05.275 --> 16:06.931
- PATRICK, STOP!
- 帕特里克，停下！

16:06.965 --> 16:08.448
SOMEHOW, YOUR HELP
JUST ISN'T HELPING.
不知何故，你的帮助
只是没有帮助。

16:08.482 --> 16:10.206
I AM MORE NERVOUS
ABOUT THIS ORAL REPORT
我比较紧张
关于本口头报告

16:10.241 --> 16:11.448
THAN I'VE EVER BEEN
ABOUT ANYTHING.
比我曾经经历过的
关于任何事情。

16:11.482 --> 16:12.896
[teeth chattering]
[牙齿打战]

16:12.931 --> 16:14.551
- YEAH, YOU DO LOOK
PRETTY TERRIBLE.
- 是的，你确实看起来
非常糟糕。

16:14.586 --> 16:16.103
- WELL, IF I DON'T DO
MY REPORT,
- 好吧，如果我不这样做
我的报告，

16:16.137 --> 16:17.206
THEN I DON'T PASS.
那我就不通过了。

16:17.241 --> 16:18.620
AND IF I DON'T PASS,
如果我没有通过，

16:18.655 --> 16:20.103
THEN I DON'T GET
MY BOATING LICENSE.
然后我不明白
我的划船执照。

16:20.137 --> 16:22.034
[sobbing]
[抽泣]

16:22.068 --> 16:23.551
- WAIT, BUDDY.
- 等等，伙计。

16:23.586 --> 16:25.103
I KNOW HOW YOU CAN GET
YOUR BOATING LICENSE.
我知道你怎样才能得到
您的划船执照。

16:25.137 --> 16:27.068
YOUR FRIEND THE SQUIRREL GIRL
IS REAL GOOD
你的朋友松鼠女孩
真的很好吗

16:27.103 --> 16:28.482
WITH HER PAWS.
用她的爪子。

16:28.517 --> 16:31.034
MAYBE SHE COULD MAKE YOU
A FAKE ONE.
也许她可以让你
一个假的。

16:31.068 --> 16:32.896
- NO, PATRICK.
THAT'S ILLEGAL.
- 不，帕特里克。
这是非法的。

16:32.931 --> 16:34.655
BUT SHE MIGHT BE ABLE
TO HELP ME
但她也许可以
帮助我

16:34.689 --> 16:36.241
GET OVER THIS ANXIETY.
克服这种焦虑。

16:36.275 --> 16:37.586
SHE'S ALWAYS SPEAKING
AT SCIENCE CONFERENCES.
她总是在说话
在科学会议上。

16:37.620 --> 16:39.379
SHE'S PROBABLY FULL
OF POINTERS.
她可能已经吃饱了
指针。

16:39.413 --> 16:42.034
- YEAH, OR SHE PROBABLY HAS
A ROBOT
- 是的，或者她可能有
机器人

16:42.068 --> 16:44.517
THAT CAN DEMOLISH
THE WHOLE SCHOOL FOR YA.
这可以摧毁
整个学校都为你服务。

16:47.551 --> 16:49.206
- WHITE KNUCKLES...
- 白指关节...

16:49.241 --> 16:50.689
LEAKY PORES...
毛孔渗漏...

16:50.724 --> 16:52.620
STOMACH IN KNOTS...
胃打结...

16:52.655 --> 16:53.862
YEP.
是的。

16:53.896 --> 16:55.620
IT LOOKS PRETTY BAD.
看起来很糟糕。

16:55.655 --> 16:58.724
SPONGEBOB, YOU'RE AFFLICTED
WITH SEVERE ORAL-REPORTITIS.
海绵宝宝，你有病了
患有严重的口头报告炎。

16:58.758 --> 17:00.827
YOU KNOW,
PATIENTS WITH THIS DISEASE
你知道，
患有这种疾病的患者

17:00.862 --> 17:02.655
HAVE BEEN KNOWN
TO PHYSICALLY EXPLODE.
已为人所知
物理爆炸。

17:02.689 --> 17:04.068
KERPOW!
克尔波！

17:04.103 --> 17:05.482
- AIEEE!
YA YAIII!
- AIEEE！
呀呀呀！

17:05.517 --> 17:07.000
- IT HAS BEEN
SCIENTIFICALLY PROVEN
- 已经是
科学证明

17:07.034 --> 17:08.724
THAT 85%
OF SPEECH-RELATED STRESS
那 85%
与言语相关的压力

17:08.758 --> 17:10.137
CAN BE ALLEVIATED
可以缓解

17:10.172 --> 17:11.241
IF THE SPEAKER IMAGINES
THE AUDIENCE
如果说话者想象
观众

17:11.275 --> 17:15.448
IN THEIR UNDERWEAR.
在他们的内衣里。

17:15.482 --> 17:17.172
EVERYONE WILL LOOK SO SILLY,
每个人都会看起来很傻，

17:17.206 --> 17:18.482
YOU WON'T REMEMBER
YOU'RE NERVOUS.
你不会记得
你很紧张。

17:18.517 --> 17:20.448
WHICH IS WHY
I INVENTED THESE.
这就是为什么
我发明了这些。

17:20.482 --> 17:22.586
GOGGLES THAT LET YOU SEE PEOPLE
IN THEIR UNDIES.
让你看到人的护目镜
穿着他们的内裤。

17:22.620 --> 17:24.586
OR I COULD JUST MAKE YOU
A FAKE BOATING LICENSE.
或者我可以让你
假划船执照。

17:24.620 --> 17:25.758
- THAT'S STILL ILLEGAL.
- 这仍然是非法的。

17:25.793 --> 17:27.758
GIMME THE GOGGLES.
把护目镜给我。

17:27.793 --> 17:30.172
[thunk]
[重击]

17:30.206 --> 17:31.551
- IT'S NOT WORKING.
- 它不起作用。

17:31.586 --> 17:32.827
- WELL, OF COURSE
IT ISN'T, SILLY.
- 嗯，当然
事实并非如此，傻瓜。

17:32.862 --> 17:34.275
I'M ONLY WEARING
MY UNDIES.
我只穿
我的内裤。

17:34.310 --> 17:36.206
SEE IF THEY WORK
ON PATRICK.
看看它们是否有效
关于帕特里克。

17:36.241 --> 17:37.827
[boink]
[乱搞]

17:37.862 --> 17:39.655
- UGH.
YEAH, THEY WORK.
- 呃。
是的，它们有效。

17:39.689 --> 17:42.517
[cheery pirate music]
[欢快的海盗音乐]

17:42.551 --> 17:45.310
- AND THEY WERE NEVER
HEARD FROM AGAIN.
- 他们从来没有
再次听到。

17:45.344 --> 17:46.586
- THANK YOU, BILLY.
- 谢谢你，比利。

17:46.620 --> 17:49.206
THAT WAS AN EXCELLENT REPORT.
这是一份非常出色的报告。

17:49.241 --> 17:53.344
NEXT, WE HAVE
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS.
接下来，我们有
海绵宝宝。

17:53.379 --> 17:54.379
AH-HMM.
啊-嗯。

17:54.413 --> 17:59.172
- GO ON, BUDDY.
- 继续吧，伙计。

17:59.206 --> 18:02.137
- AHEM.
- 咳咳。

18:02.172 --> 18:03.137
[gulp]
[吞咽]

18:03.172 --> 18:05.758
- WELL, SPONGEBOB?
- 嗯，海绵宝宝？

18:05.793 --> 18:07.655
DO YOU HAVE
YOUR ORAL REPORT READY?
你有吗
您的口头报告准备好了吗？

18:07.689 --> 18:09.931
- HUH?
- THE ASSIGNMENT I GAVE YOU?
- 嗯？
- 我给你的作业？

18:09.965 --> 18:12.758
THE ONE WHERE YOU TALK
IN FRONT OF THE CLASS?
与您交谈的地方
在全班同学面前？

18:12.793 --> 18:15.448
- OH, YEAH!
OF COURSE I'M READY.
- 哦，是啊！
我当然准备好了。

18:15.482 --> 18:16.689
I CAN DO IT.
我能做到。

18:16.724 --> 18:18.034
[clock ticking]
[时钟滴答作响]

18:18.068 --> 18:19.034
UM...
嗯...

18:19.068 --> 18:22.034
[threatening music]
[威胁性音乐]

18:22.068 --> 18:27.724
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪

18:27.758 --> 18:30.172
OH, NO.
OH, NO.
哦，不。
哦，不。

18:30.206 --> 18:32.655
- WHAT ARE YOU DOING?
- 你在干什么？

18:32.689 --> 18:35.344
- MRS. PUFF, DO I REALLY HAVE
TO DO THIS?
- 太太。噗，我真的有吗
要这样做吗？

18:35.379 --> 18:36.896
- NO.
- 不。

18:36.931 --> 18:39.896
ONLY IF YOU WANT
TO PASS THIS CLASS.
只要您愿意
通过这门课。

18:39.931 --> 18:43.724
[painfully]
- OKAY.
[痛苦地]
- 好吧。

18:43.758 --> 18:47.551
UM, MY REPORT IS ON...
嗯，我的报告正在...

18:47.586 --> 18:49.482
[threatening music]
[威胁性音乐]

18:49.517 --> 18:51.310
HEH, MUST BE
LAST-MINUTE JITTERS.
呵呵，一定是
最后一刻的紧张。

18:51.344 --> 18:59.517
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪

18:59.551 --> 19:01.034
PATRICK, WHERE ARE THOSE
GOGGLES?
帕特里克，那些在哪里
护目镜？

19:01.068 --> 19:03.482
- HERE, LET ME POLISH 'EM
UP FOR YA.
- 来，让我打磨一下
为你加油。

19:03.517 --> 19:05.241
[crunch]
[紧缩]

19:05.275 --> 19:06.655
HERE YOU GO.
干得好。

19:06.689 --> 19:07.931
- THANKS.
- 谢谢。

19:07.965 --> 19:10.620
[thunk]
[重击]

19:10.655 --> 19:14.379
- HURRY UP!
- 快点！

19:14.413 --> 19:15.551
- OH!
- 哦！

19:15.586 --> 19:18.655
HA!
哈！

19:18.689 --> 19:20.551
AH, IT'S WORKING!
HA, HA, HA!
啊，它起作用了！
哈，哈，哈！

19:20.586 --> 19:22.758
[laughing]
[笑]

19:22.793 --> 19:24.379
- WHAT'S ALL THIS
LAUGHING ABOUT?
- 这是什么？
笑什么？

19:24.413 --> 19:25.689
WELL, SPONGEBOB?
嗯，海绵宝宝？

19:25.724 --> 19:28.172
- [laughing]
- [笑]

19:28.206 --> 19:29.620
HOO.
呼。

19:29.655 --> 19:31.517
BOATING SAFETY
IS THE RESPONSIBILITY
划船安全
就是责任

19:31.551 --> 19:33.034
OF EVERY BOATER
IN THE OCEAN BECAUSE--
每个划船者的
在海洋中因为——

19:33.068 --> 19:35.379
[fritzing]
[炸毛]

19:38.034 --> 19:39.172
- WELL, DON'T JUST STAND THERE.
- 好吧，别只是站在那里。

19:39.206 --> 19:40.172
GET ON WITH IT.
继续吧。

19:40.206 --> 19:41.620
- DAAAHHH!
- 啊啊啊！

19:41.655 --> 19:45.137
- [shouting and complaining]
- [大喊大叫和抱怨]

19:45.172 --> 19:46.655
- THEY'RE ALL STARING.
- 他们都盯着看。

19:46.689 --> 19:49.620
WHOOOOA!
哇哦！

19:49.655 --> 19:51.275
- HEY, WHERE YOU GOING?
- 嘿，你要去哪里？

19:51.310 --> 19:52.931
YOU FORGOT THE GOGGLES.
你忘了带护目镜。

19:52.965 --> 19:54.620
SPONGEBOB, WAIT!
海绵宝宝，等等！

19:54.655 --> 19:56.172
[tires squealing]
[轮胎吱吱声]

19:56.206 --> 19:58.413
WAIT, SPONGEBOB!
等等，海绵宝宝！

19:58.448 --> 19:59.896
- YOU CAN'T TAKE MY BOAT.
- 你不能抢我的船。

19:59.931 --> 20:02.448
SPONGEBOB!
海绵宝宝！

20:02.482 --> 20:06.241
- WAIT!
- 等待！

20:06.275 --> 20:07.275
SPONGEBOB!
海绵宝宝！

20:07.310 --> 20:11.137
- GET BACK HERE WITH MY BOAT!
- 带着我的船回到这里！

20:11.172 --> 20:12.586
- YEA!
- 是的！

20:12.620 --> 20:13.586
YEAH!
是的！

20:13.620 --> 20:16.275
[tires squealing]
[轮胎吱吱声]

20:16.310 --> 20:18.137
- [screaming]
- [尖叫]

20:22.310 --> 20:23.793
[voices on radio]
[广播中的声音]

20:23.827 --> 20:25.206
- TALK ABOUT A SLOW DAY
AT THE OFFICE, HUH?
- 谈论缓慢的一天
在办公室，嗯？

20:25.241 --> 20:27.241
- YOU SAID IT, PARTNER.
- 你说过的，伙伴。

20:27.275 --> 20:29.000
MY BATON'S ITCHING
FOR THE NOGGIN
我的接力棒很痒
为了头脑

20:29.034 --> 20:30.551
OF A LAWBREAKER.
违法者的。

20:30.586 --> 20:33.068
- [screaming]
- [尖叫]

20:33.103 --> 20:34.413
[ding]
[叮]

20:34.448 --> 20:36.482
- OKAY, FORGET WHAT I JUST SAID.
- 好吧，忘记我刚才说的话。

20:36.517 --> 20:37.482
[tires squealing]
[轮胎吱吱声]

20:37.517 --> 20:40.034
[siren blaring]
[警笛鸣响]

20:42.724 --> 20:45.206
SPONGE, PULL OVER.
海绵，靠边停车。

20:45.241 --> 20:47.655
- I DON'T KNOW HOW!
- 我不知道怎么办！

20:47.689 --> 20:49.620
[siren continues]
[警笛继续]

20:49.655 --> 20:52.137
- SPONGEBOB!
- 海绵宝宝！

20:52.172 --> 20:54.448
- AGH!
-啊啊！

20:54.482 --> 20:56.448
[crash crash wham!]
[轰轰烈烈！]

20:56.482 --> 20:58.241
[whang!]
[哇！]

20:58.275 --> 20:59.827
[tires squealing]
[轮胎吱吱声]

20:59.862 --> 21:01.827
- ALL RIGHT, KID.
- 好吧，孩子。

21:01.862 --> 21:03.448
WHAT WAS THAT ALL ABOUT?
这是怎么回事？

21:03.482 --> 21:06.379
- DON'T YOU KNOW ANYTHING
ABOUT BOATING SAFETY?
- 你什么都不知道吗
关于划船安全？

21:06.413 --> 21:09.172
- BOATING SAFETY?
- 划船安全？

21:09.206 --> 21:11.758
YES, OFFICER, I DO.
是的，警官，我愿意。

21:11.793 --> 21:13.379
BOATING SAFETY
IS THE RESPONSIBILITY
划船安全
就是责任

21:13.413 --> 21:15.586
OF EVERY BOATER
IN THE WHOLE OCEAN.
每个划船者的
在整个海洋中。

21:15.620 --> 21:17.827
EACH BOATER MUST FOLLOW
THE RULES AND REGULATIONS
每个划船者都必须遵守
规则和规定

21:17.862 --> 21:19.655
STIPULATED IN THE BOATER'S
SAFETY HANDBOOK.
划船者规定
安全手册。

21:19.689 --> 21:21.413
LEARN THE MEANING
OF ALL POSTED SIGNS.
了解其含义
所有张贴的标志。

21:21.448 --> 21:23.586
WHEN CONSIDERING
SPEED LIMITS,
当考虑时
速度限制，

21:23.620 --> 21:25.103
PAY ATTENTION
TO ONE'S SURROUNDINGS.
注意
到一个人的周围环境。

21:25.137 --> 21:26.034
BLAH, BLAH, BLAH.
RED MEANS NO PARKING.
巴拉，巴拉，巴拉。
红色表示禁止停车。

21:26.068 --> 21:27.379
ALWAYS OBEY AUTHORITY FIGURES.
始终服从权威人士。

21:27.413 --> 21:29.034
RESPECT THE RIGHTS
OF PEDESTRIANS.
尊重权利
行人。

21:29.068 --> 21:30.344
ALWAYS BLAH, BLAH, BLAH,
AND FAMILIARIZE YOURSELF
总是废话，废话，废话，
并熟悉一下自己

21:30.379 --> 21:31.448
WITH ALL SHADES OF CURB.
各种颜色的路边。

21:31.482 --> 21:33.379
BLAH, BLAH, BLAH, BLAH.
巴拉，巴拉，巴拉，巴拉。

21:33.413 --> 21:35.344
BLAH BLAH-BLAH BLAH.
巴拉巴拉巴拉巴拉巴拉巴拉。

21:35.379 --> 21:37.000
REMEMBER, BLAH, BLAH.
记住，废话，废话。

21:37.034 --> 21:38.758
A MOTOR VEHICLE
IS 2,000 POUNDS OF BLAH BLAH.
机动车
是 2,000 磅的废话。

21:38.793 --> 21:40.620
AND BLAH BLAH,
IT'S IN YOUR BLAH.
还有巴拉巴拉，
这是你的废话。

21:40.655 --> 21:42.827
- GEE, KID.
THAT WAS BEAUTIFUL.
- 天哪，孩子。
那太漂亮了。

21:42.862 --> 21:44.448
- [sniffling]
YEAH.
- [抽鼻子]
是的。

21:44.482 --> 21:46.896
I NEVER EVEN KNEW
SOME OF THOSE THINGS MYSELF.
我从来不知道
我自己的一些事情。

21:46.931 --> 21:47.896
- AHA!
- 啊哈！

21:47.931 --> 21:49.448
FINALLY.
最后。

21:49.482 --> 21:51.724
THE LONG ARM OF THE LAW
HAS CAUGHT UP WITH YOU.
法律的长臂
已经追上你了。

21:51.758 --> 21:52.896
I GUESS I WON'T
BE SEEING YOU
我想我不会
见到你

21:52.931 --> 21:55.068
IN MY DRIVER'S EDUCATION CLASS
在我的驾驶员教育课程中

21:55.103 --> 21:58.551
FOR THE NEXT
5 TO 10 YEARS.
为了下一个
5 到 10 年。

21:58.586 --> 22:00.551
[laughing wickedly]
[邪恶地笑]

22:00.586 --> 22:02.137
- WAIT, WAIT, MISS CHUCKLES.
- 等等，等等，笑小姐。

22:02.172 --> 22:04.310
DID YOU SAY YOU WERE
HIS BOATING INSTRUCTOR?
你说过你是吗
他的划船教练？

22:04.344 --> 22:05.896
- YES. WHY?
- 是的。为什么？

22:05.931 --> 22:08.517
- UNDER PENAL CODE 26-1,
QUOTE,
- 根据刑法第 26-1 条，
报价，

22:08.551 --> 22:11.655
"THE BOATING INSTRUCTOR
IS RESPONSIBLE--"
“划船教练
有责任——”

22:11.689 --> 22:12.724
- "FOR ANY MINOR'S
DELINQUENT ACTIONS
- “对于任何未成年人
违法行为

22:12.758 --> 22:14.068
UNDER THAT TEACHER'S CARE."
在那位老师的照顾下。”

22:14.103 --> 22:15.758
- UNQUOTE.
- 取消引用。

22:15.793 --> 22:18.137
I'M AFRAID WE'RE GONNA HAVE
TO TAKE YOU IN, MADAME.
我担心我们将会有
带您进去，女士。

22:18.172 --> 22:20.655
- WHAT?
- 什么？

22:20.689 --> 22:21.862
NO!
不！

22:21.896 --> 22:23.413
[siren blaring]
[警笛鸣响]

22:23.448 --> 22:25.517
- HEY, BUDDY,
YOU GOT OVER YOUR FEAR
- 嘿，伙计，
你克服了恐惧

22:25.551 --> 22:27.310
OF GIVING
AN ORAL TALKING THING.
给予的
口头谈话的事情。

22:27.344 --> 22:28.482
- HEY, I DID.
- 嘿，我做到了。

22:28.517 --> 22:29.793
THANKS, PAL.
谢谢，朋友。

22:29.827 --> 22:30.862
- OH, THAT REMINDS ME.
- 哦，这让我想起了。

22:30.896 --> 22:33.517
YOU FORGOT THESE.
你忘记了这些。

22:33.551 --> 22:35.068
WHOA!
哇啊！

22:35.103 --> 22:37.344
OH, THEY REALLY WORK.
哦，它们确实有效。

22:37.379 --> 22:40.034
- AND WHAT ARE YOU
LOOKIN' AT?
- 你是谁
在看吗？

22:40.068 --> 22:43.965
- OH! AGH!
- 哦！哎哟！

